          "type": "html_block",
          "settings": {
            "html": "<p><strong>• Constant Freshness:</strong> Ensure your pet has access to clean and fresh water at all times.</p>\n<p><strong>• Hydration Boost:</strong> Encourage your pet to drink more water, promoting overall health.</p>\n<p><strong>• Low Maintenance:</strong> Reduce the hassle of frequent refills with a larger water capacity.</p>\n<p><strong>• Convenience:</strong> Perfect for busy pet owners, as it requires less monitoring and filling.</p>\n<p>Upgrade your pet's hydration routine with the convenience and health benefits of a pet water fountain.</p>"
